  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 5863 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E3", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Both Corvale East and Corvale General stock quetiapine fumarate labeled by Aurobindo Pharma Limited under NDC 65862049101.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies the registered plant as Aurobindo Pharma Limited with FEI 3004021229.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 684552 for that FEI ended on 2010-09-24 and was classified OAI, with a known date of 2010-12-23.",
      "cites": ["E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 5863 days before the posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections 750125, 940768, 1010385, 1061698, 1090627, 1155879, and 1210950 were all classified VAI, the most recent ending 2023-07-21.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 6 days on hand and Corvale General has 24 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer 65 units from Corvale General to Corvale East; Corvale General would retain about 14 days on hand and Corvale East would reach about 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    }
  ]
}
